| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `Dockerfile` | Builds on `ghcr.io/papercrane/base-cuda12:latest`, clones upstream at a pinned SHA. |
| `manifest.json` | `ToolManifest` — catalog entry. |
| `schemas/input.json` | JSON Schema for `{{id}}`-specific `toolParams`. |
| `schemas/output.json` | JSON Schema for `/outputs/result.json`. |
