| `tests/` | `pytest` suite (no GPU needed). |

## Upstream

- Source: `{{upstreamRepo}}`
- Pinned SHA: `{{shaPlaceholder}}_{{id}}_SHA` (Dockerfile `ARG UPSTREAM_SHA`)
- **Not** vendored as a git submodule — cloned at image build time.

To promote a new upstream version, set the commit SHA in CI build args,
rebuild, and bump `adapterVersion` in `manifest.json` if the wrapper changes.

